{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'm Maj. Alvarez, the Battalion Executive Officer, and I'll be publishing the battalion's final material-handling schedule after this coordination meeting. We have one 10,000-pound forklift available from 0800 through 1200 tomorrow, and two scheduled movements: unloading refrigerated medical pallets and moving engineering barrier pallets. Before we proceed, I need each movement lead to state the planned timing, location, and safety controls for their respective movement. Once we agree on any timing, location, or equipment controls, the responsible movement lead will enter them on the movement board. Please also note that for the refrigerated medical pallets, the schedule's coordination line must identify a direct carrier contact for that time-limited temperature-controlled delivery -- updating the movement board alone won't satisfy that requirement. Let's get started. Who's leading the refrigerated medical pallet movement?"}
```

